eb-9886-43da3377e24a")) (text "J1/J4: BOTTOM female SMD sockets. J5: four THT wire holes for short USB2 pigtail into A1 USB-C socket." (at 25 80 0) (effects (font (size 1.12 1.12)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a0499b52-64fb-4382-888d-b6940bd1c36f")) (text "A1 has no D+/D- on its 14 edge pins. Four-wire USB data/power enters the ONBOARD USB-C port." (at 25 91 0) (effects (font (size 1.12 1.12)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "87c93a26-1e8a-42f8-a1d9-9eca58057e21")) (text "ADS1115 upright along the RIGHT wing, as requested. Module overhang may use the 44mm cylinder clearance." (at 25 220 0) (effects (font (size 1.12 1.12)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7e5fff8d-6a4a-4de8-b2e8-e6fd1b524a2a")) (text "J1: direct analog outputs to AIN0/AIN1; D4/D5 -> SDA/SCL; ADDR -> GND (0x48)." (at 25 232 0) (effects (font (size 1.12 1.12)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cef0304c-96b2-43fc-b830-829d875bb315")) (text "Remove only the lower-left CABLE relief on this upper board. Keep the cuvette opening and other reliefs." (at 25 244 0) (effects (font (size 1.12 1.12)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6631fc04-7c96-44c0-8c72-d7537420fc16")) (text "A1/U2/J5 on B (components up); C5/J1/J4 on F (solder side). Route F.Cu. Confirm actual module pinout." (at 25 256 0) (effects (font (size 1.12 1.12)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0457d95f-7f80-46da-b93a-a81c5b5cfc17")) (text "No board CC net: phone plug needs local Rd / OTG adaptation; XIAO pigtail must be legacy USB2 compatible. Verify both ends." (at 25 268 0) (effects (font (size 1.12 1.12)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b5936c8e-bb13-4731-9aac-c520a3220619")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))
